{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "name": "Sport",
  "theme": "sportdash",
  "_about": "iX Cluster's Sport, adapted from Cluster Themes' Sport (after BMW's Live Cockpit Sport view): speed on the left bracket, battery power on the right on a labelled display scale (evtokens.js; eDrive blue while recuperating), the charge level up the left bracket's leg and the battery temperature (-10..50 C) up the right one's. The road in the middle runs with the speed; with the Waze map up the speed and selector move into the brackets. The bottom strip: battery power (kW, negative into the battery) and battery temperature. Then the clock, electric range and outside temperature, with BMW's own gear letter.",
